{
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-transcribed from IITK_Minor_Courses_Catalogue.md, which compiles the DOAA",
    "minor templates, credit requirements, eligibility criteria and elective baskets.",
    "This file is authoritative for minor_basket and supersedes the text scrape of",
    "data/policy/minors-at-iitk-updated.pdf, which merged the per-stream baskets of a",
    "department into one blob, lost most of the 'choose N' figures and mangled several",
    "titles. Where a department publishes an Old/New UGARC split, the UGARC PDF remains",
    "the cited source for the split and each variant is transcribed separately.",
    "",
    "A minor is a *stream*, not a department: CSE publishes four, CHM three, HSS three,",
    "EE five. Each is one row here, because a student reads one of them.",
    "",
    "compulsory: a list of required courses. An element that is itself a list means",
    "'any one of these' - the alternatives a source states explicitly, e.g. CE643A or",
    "CE644A. Written to the database as comma-separated groups with '|' between",
    "alternatives.",
    "",
    "Course codes are written exactly as the source prints them. The schedule exports",
    "use the unsuffixed form of many of these codes (ESO207 for ESO207A), so codes are",
    "resolved against the course table at build time by aptg_ingest.codes; anything that",
    "still does not resolve is quarantined as minor.unresolved_code, never dropped."
  ],
  "institute_rules": {
    "credits_min": 27,
    "credits_max": 36,
    "courses_min": 3,
    "courses_max": 4,
